                "url": "https://editorial.rottentomatoes.com/article/the-most-anticipated-movies-of-2026/"
              },
              "number": 1,
              "passage": "The Most Anticipated Movies of 2026\n\nThe year is flush with the usual blockbuster franchise titles, but we've also got some thrilling genre fare and new projects from the likes of Steven Spielberg, Christopher Nolan, and Jordan Peele, among others.\n\nBy Amrita Vora | Updated October 5, 2026\n\nTAGGED AS: movies\n\nBased on what we know so far, 2026 is shaping up to be pretty great, with a healthy mix of the expected blockbuster franchise titles, enticing genre films, and new projects from the likes of Steven Spielberg, Christopher Nolan, and Jordan Peele. With that in mind, here’s a handy calendar of some of the most noteworthy titles coming in 2026 so you can budget and plan accordingly.\n\nRecommended: The Best Movies of 2025\n\nJanuary – July\n\nAUGUST\n\nThe End of Oak Street (2026)\n\nRelease Date: August 14, 2026\nDirector: David Robert Mitchell\nStarring: Anne Hathaway, Ewan McGreggor, Maisy Stella",
              "passageHash": "sha256:e41c2fbcf49669cd22cef813b8c6f6b1eb86c7ce1b9b90ff2c6855d0b1a0b632",
              "passageOrigin": "extract",
              "retrievedAt": 1792256325067,
              "sourceId": "web-1",
              "title": "The Most Anticipated Movies of 2026 | Rotten Tomatoes",
              "truncated": false,
              "url": "https://editorial.rottentomatoes.com/article/the-most-anticipated-movies-of-2026/"
            },
            {
              "contentHash": "sha256:c1bdccb80b26439f1f3daebf8e1095434a46519fb5c1c948afa0466866ab1c5d",
              "document": {
                "bytes": 433059,
